{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>רבת</b> — a measure of time." "<b>הלעג השאננים</b> — like <b>הספר המקנה</b> (the book that acquires)." "<b>הלעג</b> — the mockery of the complacent." "<b>והבוז</b> — contempt of the proud, and it is one word, like עליונים, from the root גאה."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 123, :notes {3 "Reading לגאיונים as ל־גאיונים ('of the proud') based on the immediately following explanation; alternatively the prefixed bet could belong to the lemma."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:15.051339142Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}